---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../i18n/ui';

const t = useTranslations('en');
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & Disclaimer | Kampo Medicine">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy & Disclaimer</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-purple max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">1. Medical Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The information provided on this website (Kampo Medicine), including explanations of Kampo medicine, research papers, molecular biology, intestinal flora, and nutrition, is for educational and informational purposes only and is <strong>not intended as a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</strong></p>
        <p>Always seek the advice of your physician, pharmacist, or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay in seeking it because of something you have read on this website. The site operators are not liable for any health issues or damages incurred from the use of this information.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">2. Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information (based on recent research and evidence), we cannot guarantee the absolute accuracy, completeness, or safety of all content. Due to advancements in medical and scientific research, older articles may not reflect the most current consensus.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">3. Collection and Use of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>Any personal information, such as names and email addresses, collected via contact forms or inquiries will only be used to respond to your questions or provide necessary information via email. It will not be used for any other purpose.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">4. Analytics Tools</h2>
        <p>This website may use analytics tools (such as Google Analytics) provided by Google to measure traffic and improve our services. These tools use cookies to collect traffic data anonymously, and this data does not identify individuals. You can refuse this collection by disabling cookies in your browser settings.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">5. Copyrights and Portrait Rights</h2>
        <p>Unauthorized reproduction of text, images, or any other content published on this site is strictly prohibited. This site does not intend to infringe on any copyrights or portrait rights. If you identify any issues regarding copyright or portrait rights, please contact us via the contact form, and we will address it promptly.</p>
      </section>
      
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t text-sm text-gray-500">
        Last Updated: March 2026
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
